@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title AFTER MVP — SM-M12 — Sprint period and recorded actual outcome
state "Planned" as Planned
state "Active" as Active
state "Completed period; actual\noutcome recorded" as Completed
state "Cancelled period; history\nretained" as Cancelled
[*] --> Planned : scoped initial context
Planned --> Active : SM-T072 start confirmed\n[valid start / coherent plan]
Planned --> Cancelled : SM-T073 cancel confirmed\n[authorized / confirmed]
Active --> Active : SM-T074 plan adaptation confirmed\n[reviewed active change]
Active --> Completed : SM-T075 end confirmed\n[actual outcome recorded]
Active --> Cancelled : SM-T076 cancel confirmed\n[authorized / confirmed]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
